{
  "_doc": "Relations between the components (docs/app/DECISIONS.md D-81). links: from needs/uses to, with the versions of `to` it runs on (`range`, npm syntax); parts are named `component/part`. runtimes: what the PC must provide for some components. projects: files of a project that declare the version of a component. Read by relations.rs, which builds the matrix in data\\app\\relations.json.",
  "links": [
    { "from": "php/composer", "to": "php", "kind": "runs-on", "range": ">=7.2.5", "note": "Composer 2.3 e successivi; per PHP più vecchi il kit sceglie il 2.2 LTS" },
    { "from": "apache", "to": "php", "kind": "loads", "range": ">=8.0 <9", "note": "modulo php8apache2_4.dll, PHP Thread Safe x64" },
